287 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 45 0 R
/T (Where did the medicine go? Was it never delivered, was the record not updated, or is there another problem? MedStock AI adds an intelligence and accountability layer to existing medicine systems. It tracks dispatch and receipt, detects unusual stock patterns, predicts shortages, recommends transfers and lets citizens report medicine non-availability. Reports are verified by authorised officials, not treated as automatic proof of wrongdoing. Our goal is simple: every medicine should be accounted for, every shortage should be identified and every patient should have reliable information.)
/E (Where did the medicine go? Was it never delivered, was the record not updated, or is there another problem? MedStock AI adds an intelligence and accountability layer to existing medicine systems. It tracks dispatch and receipt, detects unusual stock patterns, predicts shortages, recommends transfers and lets citizens report medicine non-availability. Reports are verified by authorised officials, not treated as automatic proof of wrongdoing. Our goal is simple: every medicine should be accounted for, every shortage should be identified and every patient should have reliable information.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [49]
>>
endobj
